# A Math block with an override of its b input, which no Script can give, uses it instead of the Wire
place-start
place-block generator as g
set-block-setting g power 9
place-block generator as n
set-block-setting n power 2
place-block math as m
set-block-setting m op multiply
place-block power_display as p
wire-blocks g out to m a
wire-blocks n out to m b
wire-blocks m out to p x
move-block p 16 0 -8
test-mode
wait 2
expect-display p 18
back-to-editor

set-stored-setting m text oi2 5
test-mode
wait 2
expect-signal m b 2
expect-display p 45
back-to-editor

# One undo takes it back
undo
wait 1
test-mode
wait 2
expect-display p 18
back-to-editor

expect-step-fails set-stored-setting nope text oi2 5 because no block was placed or named as "nope"
expect-no-exceptions
